     1078   PROCEDURE set-attribute-list :
     1079     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-attr-list    AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1080     RUN ensure-broker.
     1081     RUN broker-set-attribute-list IN adm-broker-hdl
     1082         (INPUT THIS-PROCEDURE, INPUT p-attr-list) NO-ERROR.
